{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 1, "model_name": "google/gemma-3n-e2b-it", "content": "Hark gentle traveler to Japan's shore\nA journey grand a sight to adore\nFrom ancient temples to cities bright\nWe weave a path with pure delight.\n\n**Day One: Arrival in Tokyo's Embrace**\n\nUpon arrival at Narita's gate\nThy weary limbs we shall elevate\nTo Shinjuku's heights a bustling scene\nWhere neon glows a vibrant sheen.\nA ramen feast a savory treat\nThen rest thy head a slumber sweet.\n\n**Day Two: Imperial Grandeur & Culture's Gleam**\n\nTo Imperial Palace we now do stray\nWhere history breathes in a regal way\nThe Ginza district a shopper's dream\nWith silks and gems a dazzling gleam.\nA Sumida River cruise serene\nA cultural show a joyful mien.\n\n**Day Three: Hakone's Volcanic Beauty**\n\nTo Hakone's hills we make our flight\nA mountain realm bathed in soft light\nA volcanic hot spring's gentle steam\nA painter's vision a waking dream.\nThe Lake Ashi's beauty pure and bold\nA story whispered ages old.\n\n**Day Four: Kyoto's Ancient Heart**\n\nBy train we journey to Kyoto's grace\nA city steeped in time and space\nFushimi Inari's gates so red\nA thousand torii overhead.\nKinkaku-ji's gold a wondrous sight\nReflecting sun with dazzling light.\n\n**Day Five: Gion's Geishas & Bamboo's Sway**\n\nIn Gion's district we softly tread\nWhere geishas glide expertly led\nArashiyama's bamboo grove so tall\nA verdant whisper enchanting all.\nA tea ceremony a mindful art\nA peaceful solace for the heart.\n\n**Day Six: Nara's Deer & Todai-ji's Might**\n\nTo Nara we venture forth with glee\nTo see the deer wild and free\nTodai-ji's Buddha a giant's form\nA sacred presence weathering the storm.\nA temple visit a prayerful sound\nIn ancient glory peace is found.\n\n**Day Seven: Return to Tokyo & Farewell**\n\nBack to Tokyo we gently glide\nWith memories treasured deep inside\nA final stroll a last embrace\nOf Japan's beauty time and space.\nThen homeward bound